n by  an ethereal force of evil in order to  lure people in  and prey upon their fears the clown  manifestation is one of many that this  ancient entity has assumed over the  course of centuries to prey upon the  children of derry maine  every 27 years author stephen king chose  the form of the clown  after asking himself what scared  children more than anything else in the  world  the fear of children was central because  one of the entities main powers is its  ability to go  undetected by adults the killer clown  sewer habitat meanwhile was inspired by  the goat who dwells under a bridge in  the three billy goats gruff fairy tale  in just about every way the pennywise  disguise represents a villain designed  specifically for targeting children  popcorn is that your favorite uh-huh  well i do hockey is a pretty violent  sport  though not quite as violent as serial  killing nonetheless  the sport's traditional goalie mask is  inextricably linked with one of the  greatest horror movie villains of all  time  the world first met jason voorhees in  1980s friday the 13th but it actually  wasn't until 1982's friday the 13th part  3  that his trademark mask first came into  the picture  courtesy of jason victim shelly  previously  jason wore a burlap sack with one left  eye hole to hide his face  jason will go on to wear the mask until  his supposed death via bludgeoning from  a kid named tommy in the 4th  friday the 13th film but even after  getting hacked up with a machete and  buried  the legacy of his mask lived on a  similar mask is worn by his copycat  killer roy burns in the next film  also tommy has a nervous breakdown and  nearly becomes a copycat killer himself  while donning a similar hockey mask  following this in the sixth film tommy  goes to make sure  jason is dead throws the mask on his  grave and accidentally revives the  killer through lightning  jason then stumbles his way through  movie after movie  as his mask gets increasingly beaten up  halloween's m